# Never send the database, local settings, secrets or installed modules into a
# build. The data folder can sit anywhere a dev server was run from.
**/data
**/.env
**/.env.*
compose.override.yaml
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
app/test/.corpus
.git
.shots
tools/screenshot
# Local agent and planning files.
.orca
.claude
.codex
.agents
DECISIONS.md
docs
hook
